    {
      "Text": "Security update for libXfont2",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libXfont2 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-44950: fs_read_glyphs() heap buffer overflow via cumulative glyph data overflow (bsc#1272661).\n- CVE-2026-59679: fs_read_glyphs() heap OOB read/write via encoding array index mismatch (bsc#1272660).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
